<figure class="mw-halign-right" typeof="mw:File/Thumb"><a href="/wiki/File:C5_galaxy.jpg" class="mw-file-description"><img src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e6/C5_galaxy.jpg/300px-C5_galaxy.jpg" decoding="async" width="300" height="200" class="mw-file-element" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e6/C5_galaxy.jpg/450px-C5_galaxy.jpg 1.5x, //upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e6/C5_galaxy.jpg/600px-C5_galaxy.jpg 2x" data-file-width="2400" data-file-height="1596" /></a><figcaption>People boarding a <a href="/wiki/Lockheed_C-5_Galaxy" title="Lockheed C-5 Galaxy">Lockheed C-5 Galaxy</a>, a large military cargo aircraft</figcaption></figure>
